		{
			"id": "112774097907558282",
			"parentId": 0,
			"url": "https://mastodon.social/@cferdinandi/112774049172480329",
			"author": {
				"name": "Chris Ferdinandi",
				"url": "https://mastodon.social/@cferdinandi",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/cache/accounts/avatars/109/306/986/829/446/527/original/19e80d64c6e713e0.jpg"
			},
			"date": "2024-07-12T14:43:48.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> I ran a test on this with CSS recently. got slightly different results than the Harry Roberts article that was linked in another toot <a href=\"https://gomakethings.com/modular-css-and-different-ways-to-structure-your-stylesheets/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"ellipsis\">gomakethings.com/modular-css-a</span><span class=\"invisible\">nd-different-ways-to-structure-your-stylesheets/</span></a></p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "112774135793582284",
			"parentId": "112774097907558282",
			"url": "https://mamot.fr/@nhoizey/112774135769050926",
			"author": {
				"name": "Nicolas Hoizey",
				"url": "https://mamot.fr/@nhoizey",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/cache/accounts/avatars/109/288/230/453/300/889/original/b21203c65dbd197c.jpg"
			},
			"date": "2024-07-12T15:05:49.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://mastodon.social/@cferdinandi\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>cferdinandi</span></a></span> I would say that “a concatenated file is still the most performant for people on the slowest connections and oldest devices” is only true if the concatenated file weight is low, don't you think?</p><p>On my side, as I don't have much CSS code, I even inline it all. There is no CSS network request on <a href=\"https://nicolas-hoizey.photo/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"\">nicolas-hoizey.photo/</span><span class=\"invisible\"></span></a></p><p>My tests in the past showed that is was faster than requests. Because there is not much CSS.</p><p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span></p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "112774170868934999",
			"parentId": "112774135793582284",
			"url": "https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat/112774170868934999",
			"author": {
				"name": "Zach Leatherman",
				"url": "https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/accounts/avatars/109/286/461/031/266/152/original/dc489c3746a44e00.png"
			},
			"date": "2024-07-12T15:14:44.989Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://mamot.fr/@nhoizey\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>nhoizey</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://mastodon.social/@cferdinandi\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>cferdinandi</span></a></span> yeah! I’m interested to learn at what inflection point does it start to break down (and if you fancy, what inflection point for different network connections)</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "112774179476741524",
			"parentId": "112774170868934999",
			"url": "https://mamot.fr/@nhoizey/112774179428401427",
			"author": {
				"name": "Nicolas Hoizey",
				"url": "https://mamot.fr/@nhoizey",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/cache/accounts/avatars/109/288/230/453/300/889/original/b21203c65dbd197c.jpg"
			},
			"date": "2024-07-12T15:16:55.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> I'm not sure anyone did try with different file weights to find the inflection point.</p><p>Also, I'm not sure it’s worth it trying to have a dynamic solution to account for different network connections. It's already complicated enough! 😅</p><p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://mastodon.social/@cferdinandi\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>cferdinandi</span></a></span></p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
