			"author": {
				"name": "Chris Ferdinandi",
				"url": "https://mastodon.social/@cferdinandi",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/cache/accounts/avatars/109/306/986/829/446/527/original/19e80d64c6e713e0.jpg"
			},
			"date": "2024-07-12T16:03:11.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://mamot.fr/@nhoizey\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>nhoizey</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> I also inline everything, because my combined CSS + HTML + JS is nearly always at about 14kb or less. But for the average person, that's probably a level of yak shaving that doesn't matter in a material way, IMO.</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
