			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> \"Minimum Viable Chunk\" is a good deep dive into the complexity of the problem and the trade offs you're forced to make.</p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ImjzA7EMI6I\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://www.</span><span class=\"ellipsis\">youtube.com/watch?v=ImjzA7EMI6</span><span class=\"invisible\">I</span></a></p><p>Unfortunately it kind of ends with \"You should do it like Google does, but no open source tools on the market actually do that so 🤷‍♂️.\"</p>",
