			"url": "https://mastodon.social/@Schepp/112789247278898315",
			"author": {
				"name": "Christian \"Schepp\" Schaefer",
				"url": "https://mastodon.social/@Schepp",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/cache/accounts/avatars/109/294/814/597/449/022/original/cc8d1c1e842b92c6.jpg"
			},
			"date": "2024-07-15T07:08:52.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://mamot.fr/@nhoizey\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>nhoizey</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://mastodon.social/@cferdinandi\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>cferdinandi</span></a></span> it also depends on so many other factors that you can't formulate a rule of thumb. For example, if you run nginx, then inlining CSS leads to much better FCP and LCP, as it will not send the CSS until the HTML is fully sent over the wire: <a href=\"https://x.com/derSchepp/status/1595334081969020928?t=O6P8EI8Gf_3hNjonQz0wRQ&amp;s=19\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"ellipsis\">x.com/derSchepp/status/1595334</span><span class=\"invisible\">081969020928?t=O6P8EI8Gf_3hNjonQz0wRQ&amp;s=19</span></a></p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "112789380092334286",
			"parentId": "112789247337906117",
			"url": "https://mamot.fr/@nhoizey/112789380071199157",
			"author": {
				"name": "Nicolas Hoizey",
				"url": "https://mamot.fr/@nhoizey",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/cache/accounts/avatars/109/288/230/453/300/889/original/b21203c65dbd197c.jpg"
			},
			"date": "2024-07-15T07:42:38.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://mastodon.social/@Schepp\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>Schepp</span></a></span> without an X account, I can't read the responses to your tweet, were there any?</p><p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://mastodon.social/@cferdinandi\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>cferdinandi</span></a></span></p>",
